# Complete Phase 3: Wire Up Trigger API REST Endpoints

## Problem

The Trigger API has 7 REST endpoints that currently return `501 Not Implemented`. The underlying database queries (via sqlc) and business logic (via `workflows.Service`) **already exist** — they just aren't connected to HTTP handlers. This plan wires them up.

