**3. `POST /v1/workflows/{id}/versions` — Add a new version to a workflow**

What it does: Adds a new DAG version to an existing workflow.

```go
// Request body:
// {
//   "version": 2,
//   "dag": { "nodes": [...], "edges": [...] }
// }
//
// Response (201 Created):
// {
//   "workflowId": "a1b2c3d4-...",
//   "version": 2,
